<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-FINAL RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FINAL RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</headline>
<dateline>MURCIA, Spain 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the</p>
<p>fifth and final stage of the Tour of Murcia, a time-trial over a</p>
<p>20-km city circuit, on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Juan Carlos Dominguez (Spain) Kelme  23 minutes 46 seconds</p>
<p> 2. 1. Alex Zuelle (Switzerland) ONCE		  24:03</p>
<p> 3. Ignacio Garcia Camacho (Spain) Kelme	     24:05</p>
<p> 4. Santos Gonzalez (Spain) Kelme			24:10</p>
<p> 5. Alvaro Gonzalez Galdeano (Spain) Euskadi	 24:21</p>
<p> 6. Rolf Aldag (Germany) Telekom			 24:25</p>
<p> 7. Claus Michael Moller (Denmark) Toscaf	    24:29</p>
<p> 8. Servais Knaven (Netherlands) TVM		   24:32</p>
<p> 9. Igor Gonzalez Galdeano (Spain) Euskadi	   24:35</p>
<p> 10. Pavel Padrnos (Czech Republic) Roslotto	 24:37</p>
<p>Final overall standings:</p>
<p> 1. Dominguez		  56 hours 2 minutes 40 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Garcia Camacho			    8 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Gonzalez				   24</p>
<p> 4. Moller				     47</p>
<p> 5. Zuelle				   2:26</p>
<p> 6. Padrnos				  3:00</p>
<p> 7. Michael Lafis (Sweden) Telekom   3:02</p>
<p> 8. Roberto Heras (Spain) Kelme	3:30</p>
<p> 9. Alvaro Gonzalez Galdeano	   3:32</p>
<p>10. Manuel Beltran (Spain) Banesto  3:33</p>
